  <item>
    <title>Ep.6 听夫妻夜话，赏有趣人生</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/666c0f16c26e396a36c83520</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">666c0f16c26e396a36c83520</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 14 Jun 2024 14:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播：梁玮佳 裴继琰</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：冀昌林</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主题】</span></p><span></span><p><span>热烈庆祝「嘿女孩儿」节目迎来首位嘉宾——冀昌林·AKA裴继琰老公</span></p><span></span><p><span>热烈庆祝冀昌林30岁生日，迈入而立之年</span></p><span></span><p><span>热烈庆祝「嘿女孩儿」首次从男性视角分享有趣的30岁人生感悟</span></p><span></span><p><span>连续的热烈庆祝，真是值得喝完这一杯再来三杯呢！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="70">01:10</a> 嘉宾热场环节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">03:00</a> 男生有没有年龄焦虑？不存在的！但是男人是如何看待年龄问题的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="665">11:05</a> 如何培养“松弛因子”，以及具有松弛感的人能给周围的人带来多少快乐？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1765">29:25</a> 分享一段让人羡慕的爱情——夫妻爱情观对话</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2585">43:05</a> 30岁的“中青年”如何避免油腻，保持少年感？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2849">47:29</a> 当我跑步时，我在想什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3266">54:26</a> 嘉宾赠言环节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3345">55:45</a> 本期结论</span></p><span></span><p><span>【收听及联系方式】</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢大家在苹果播客、小宇宙关注并收听「嘿女孩儿」周更节目；</span></p><span></span><p><span>也可以+vx: lwj5489，与我们建立更多交流。</span></p>]]></description>
